@Comment::[Paper: Forward-Free LLM Depth Pruning via Weight Redundancy (Yun & Lim 2026, arXiv:2609.09883). WRP selects blocks from checkpoint weights alone: CKA on centered attn-out + MLP-down Grams (Eq.1-2) + 7-projection scale cosine (Eq.3), S/2 average; spectral K in {2,4} via eigengaps vs depth-null (Eq.4-5); two-stage allocation protecting first/last. 6 settings x 9 tasks: beats Mag+ by 10.68-17.15 (avg 57.41 vs LoRP 57.93). One @Graded per table/figure (per-table granularity). Repo note: paper names no public code; search finds no implementation (0 issues reviewable) - text-faithful.]

